          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "No hour of a room is let twice",
          "status": "checked",
          "text": "The rooms refuse to book a room at an instant earlier than 24 hours after a booking of that room they already keep was made.",
          "rationale": "A booking holds its room for 24 hours from the instant it is made (§s-v5pj2nz366fp7kb), and a room has a bed for one booking at a time: a second booking within those hours promises that bed to a second regular, or charges the same regular twice for it.",
